docs {
Cabut mute kontribusi akun (contribute_muted_until = null) + netralkan skor
abuse (event admin_lift berbobot -skor30d) - hanya admin & root.
Tidak mengubah can_contribute / is_active (pakai endpoint masing-masing).
Tercatat di audit log (action lift_contribute_mute).

200 sukses:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "id": "01J...",
        "contribute_muted_until": null,
        "previous_score_30d": 5
      }
    }

404 USER_NOT_FOUND: user tidak ada / sudah dihapus.
}

meta {
  name: Lift User Mute
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/abuse/users/{{user_id}}/lift-mute
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

tests {
  test("200 + mute kosong", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.contribute_muted_until).to.equal(null);
  });
}
